# Deploy artefacts are consumed by systemd, nginx, and bash on Linux, where a
# stray CR inside an ExecStart line continuation fails in a way that reads as a
# typo. This repo runs with core.autocrlf=true, so whether a file arrives LF or
# CRLF depends on which tool wrote it — these lines take that out of play.
#
# Scoped deliberately: a repo-wide `* text=auto` would renormalise thousands of
# unrelated files in a single commit.
*.service               text eol=lf
*.conf                  text eol=lf
*.sh                    text eol=lf
.github/workflows/*.yml text eol=lf
